prim-provability</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"local-definition-checked"},{"key":"inherited_source_proof_status","html":"陈述及下述本地推导已复核；未作机器证明"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span> 使用固定有效呈示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_T\">\\(E_T\\)</span> 和 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6a4c234306a0ec0c\" href=\"?note=6a4c234306a0ec0c\" title=\"67-df-provability-predicate\">67-df-provability-predicate</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_T\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 与该证明表示使用同一编号。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProvCorrect}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{ProvCorrect}(T)\\)</span> 是下式定义的、对所给呈示相对的可证明性正确条件；不把不同公理呈示的可证明性公式视为同一个语法对象。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProvCorrect}(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\\n\\bigl((T\\vdash\\varphi)\\Longleftrightarrow(T\\vdash\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{g(\\varphi)}))\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ProvCorrect}(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\\n\\bigl((T\\vdash\\varphi)\\Longleftrightarrow(T\\vdash\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{g(\\varphi)}))\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>旧名 FComp/feferman-complete 与该式实际内容不符。此处仅断言 T 对自身可证明性的两向可证对应；不把它冠以原书或其他文献的专有完备性定理名。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"854772391cef4007","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"6a4c234306a0ec0c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-prim-provability","status":"resolved","id":"573b4c635ea6d91f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-prim-provability]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"6a4c234306a0ec0c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}$ 使用固定有效呈示 $E_T$ 和 [[67-df-provability-predicate]] 的 $\\mathrm{Prov}_T$；$g$ 与该证明表示使用同一编号。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}","display":false},{"tex":"E_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_T","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProvCorrect}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProvCorrect}(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\\n\\bigl((T\\vdash\\varphi)\\Longleftrightarrow(T\\vdash\\mathrm{Prov}_T(\\overline{g(\\varphi)}))\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1676,"backlinks":[{"id":"d283c5a3bb9835bb","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\Sigma_1}$ 与 $\\mathrm{ProvCorrect}$ 见 [[67-df-sigma1-sound]]、[[67-df-provability-correctness]]。"},{"id":"38502195e450dd58","anchor":"ref-19","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-provability-correctness